  "description": "Plumatachi was everything to Blink. Had Blink and Plumatachi’s roles been reversed during Coal Cauldron’s attack, history would have been quite different. Plumatachi would have lost her life instead of Blink. Consumed by grief, Blink would have dedicated her body and soul to avenging her, dismantling her motorcycle to create a prosthesis in order to replace the limb she lost during Coal Cauldron’s attack. She would have used Techs to create new weapons meant to kill everyone who participated in the attack.",
